---Simple SQL query---
---Retrieve data from table---
SELECT EMPLOYEE.NAME, EMPLOYEE.SURNAME FROM EMPLOYEE WHERE EMPLOYEE.SALARY>3000

Basic data types in SQL:
  INT
  VARCHAR()
  DECIMAL (M, N)
  DATE
  TIMESTAMP
  BLOB

---Delete table---
DROP TABLE EMPLOYEE

---Modify table---
ALTER TABLE EMPLOYEE ADD SALARY DECIMAL (M, N)

